{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:20 2026-10-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:36 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:36 2026-10-12 HKT</p><p>馬鞍山錦英苑一單位，今日（10月12日）晚上近9時，一名男子在維修家中洗手間漏水時，被家人發現暈倒。救護員接報給趕至，將男子送往沙田威爾斯醫院搶救，可惜至晚上10時左右宣告不治。目前事發經過及男子死因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"案件仍在調查。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1f334953dbf0872dd529f043417b6bd6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_23_09_02.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為馬鞍山錦英苑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5e45daf6a7fd6717097006a69c887f1b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_23_09_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為馬鞍山錦英苑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a5a03ac5207fa9f084bc8256984acbe/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_23_09_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子被送往沙田威爾斯醫院搶救，惜告不治。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8aee95f58812c4f12e3f862e38fa01b3/2026-10/ha_wales_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"男子被送往沙田威爾斯醫院搶救，惜告不治。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a61370e4d7c94a184acadb81e0152c9/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20260208_133032605.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T15:39:47.661545+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:20:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T20:58:01.507916+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:43.282017+00:00","content_hash":"61f734cbcdedb6b6f4a03d537694cdb3263c065e5287a307b690757fe8b12871","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}